Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Suddenly%20the%20beast%20was%20a%20human%20woman","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e16","era":null,"summary":"The woman, who says she tracked Mrs. Palter, warns them to stop killing her pack and leave the Ulvenwald, since something worse is coming.","participants":["arlinn-kord","halana","alena"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":539,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":169,"quote":"I have seen enough, and so have you, to know that whatever is out there is worse than werewolves.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=I%20have%20seen%20enough%2C,is%20worse%20than%20werewolves.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=I%20have%20seen%20enough%2C,is%20worse%20than%20werewolves.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e17","era":null,"summary":"The woman resumes wolf form and leaves; Arlinn Kord reflects she cannot have friends.","participants":["arlinn-kord","halana","alena"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":539,"story_date":"201